      "username": "Sudhanshu",
      "name": "Sudhanshu Badole",
      "created_at": "2025-08-28T05:36:46.719Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can either <strong>change the theme of the default UI</strong> to customize the look, or, if you want a <strong>completely different UI</strong>, you’ll need to <strong>build your own frontend app (like Vue.js or React)</strong> and use Frappe only as the backend.</p>\n<p>For reference, check out this repo: <a href=\"https://github.com/NagariaHussain/doppio?utm_source=chatgpt.com\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/NagariaHussain/doppio</a> — it helps you integrate SPAs (Vue/React) with Frappe easily.</p>",
